hugo_flow - contains all the files

layers - contains all implemented layers:
  Dense layer
  convolutional layer
  In development pooling layer
  Syntax:
     var = {layerType()}
     var.set_layers(x, ...) -> allows tu customize layer parameters


models - contains all the model setups
  Seqential
  Agent
  Syntax:
    var = {ModelType()} -> parameters are set up durning creation
    var.add_layer() -> adds chosen layer to model, allows to add more than one using one call
    var.run() -> runs forward and backward function with given data


utils - contains neccesary fuctions used in the project